## Summary

I shipped a production-complete, native Apple (SwiftUI) parity of the web `MediaNavigationPanel` telemetry panel — committed as `824632c3e` (11 surface files + gate log, 2204 insertions).

**Surface** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/MediaNavigationPanel.*`), following the gated `QuickNav`/`AiUsageCard` convention:
- **Now Playing** (title/artist fallbacks, source chip, Playing/Paused/neutral status tone) + **Navigation** (SI-distance destination card via `useUnits`, minutes, or "No active destination", plus Home/Work/Favorite place chips).
- **Every P4 state renders**: loading skeleton, content, empty, error+retry, stale (chip + 1× auto-refresh), offline (cached + chip) — plus all web sub-branches.
- `@Observable` state-holder (P1/S8), `view.opened` telemetry (P1/S11), per-surface i18n table (P1/S10), design tokens (P1/S9), VoiceOver labels, reduce-motion. The only `Shared`-coupled file is the isolated `.Units` bridge.

